    "problems": "The study evaluates a different intervention from the claim's direction ablation or addition. It reports no uncertainty estimates for these safety values. Utility is evaluated separately, but these results do not isolate a direction-specific capability cost.",
    "rows_left_out": "The paper also reports separate SafeBench and Ch3 Ef values, category-level ASRs in Figure 3, hyperparameter results in Tables 5–7, and an attention-head-only ablation comparison in Table 8. They are not separately tabulated here; the included core rows use reported aggregate safety values where available. Table 8's extracted text has inconsistent method labels (HSR/HSR-a versus RSAC/RSAC-a), so its individual values are not assigned to rows.",
